{
  "body_human_readable": "The 2005 film adaptation of *The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy* was produced with a budget estimated between $45 and $50 million. The movie went on to achieve a worldwide gross of approximately $104.5 million.\n\nThe film, released in the United Kingdom on April 28, 2005, and a day later in the United States, opened in first place in North America with an opening weekend of about $21.1 to $21.7 million. In the United States, it remained in the top ten at the box office for its first four weeks. The worldwide box office performance was roughly double its production budget.",
  "request": {
